      "archaeologicalRemains": "unknown",
      "details": "<p><span>The proposed location of the King's Gate is based on\u00a0</span><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://uppsala.app.box.com/s/cgm386mr39f0we39y8v49ktecc664k0k/file/722124240853\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Peders\u00e9n 2021 fig. 2.1</a><span>, which shows a plan of Babylon, with 500 m UTM coordinates given. The\u00a0suggested\u00a0coordinates correspond with a high mound that preserves traces of the ruins of the western wall of the inner city of Babylon. These might belong to the King's Gate.</span></p>",
